../20260830033859-67260d1f/logs/codex/STYLE_LOCK.attempt-1.events.json:34:      "aggregated_output": "---\nname: style-lock-generator\ndescription: Merge one human art approval with the matching candidate into an immutable style-lock.json. Use only when resuming the factory approval gate.\n---\n\n# Style Lock Generator\n\n## Trigger\n\nUse only when `human/art-approval.yaml` exists during resume. Do not infer approval, select a direction for the human,\nrequest per-asset approval, or modify the game workspace.\n\n## Inputs and outputs\n\n- Inputs: `artifacts/game-blueprint.json`, `artifacts/art-directions.json`, `human/art-approval.yaml`.\n- Output: `artifacts/style-lock.json`, validated with `StyleLockSchema`.\n\n## Procedure\n\n1. Validate approval and resolve `selected_direction` exactly; never silently fall back to another candidate.\n2. Copy the complete selected direction. Record `keep`, `change`, and `notes` without changing their intent.\n3. Apply change requests as production constraints, while retained traits remain fixed. Stamp the lock time.\n4. Return JSON only; subsequent asset prompts must cite this lock, not reinterpret the review conversation.\n\n## Acceptance\n\nSelected id exists; candidate data remains traceable; all human lists are preserved; Schema passes; no unapproved\ndirection traits are mixed in.\n\n## Failure\n\nMissing approval remains a normal waiting state. Invalid YAML, unknown id, or conflicting instructions fail the stage\nwith a targeted error and leave existing artifacts untouched.\n\n--- blueprint ---\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"gameId\": \"youkai-night-market\",\n  \"title\": \"妖怪夜市\",\n  \"theme\": \"雾夜里的妖怪点心摊\",\n  \"runtime\": \"web-lite\",\n  \"template\": \"idle-shop-v1\",\n  \"concept\": \"在雾夜点心摊烤制月露团子，为悄然来访的妖怪送上暖甜夜宵。\",\n  \"coreLoop\": [\n    \"雾中妖客到摊并提出团子订单\",\n    \"点心炉自动生产月露团子\",\n    \"将做好的团子交付给等待的妖客\",\n    \"收取妖灯作为订单奖励\",\n    \"花费妖灯升级点心炉以加快生产\"\n  ],\n  \"content\": {\n    \"productName\": \"月露团子\",\n    \"customerName\": \"雾中妖客\",\n    \"currencyName\": \"妖灯\"\n  },\n  \"balance\": {\n    \"startingCurrency\": 0,\n    \"orderReward\": 6,\n    \"baseUpgradeCost\": 18\n  },\n  \"preferences\": {\n    \"tone\": \"温暖神秘\",\n    \"audience\": \"轻度休闲玩家\",\n    \"session_minutes\": 3\n  }\n}\n\n--- directions ---\n{\n  \"directions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"direction_a\",\n      \"name\": \"灯纸小戏台\",\n      \"summary\": \"将夜市塑造成正面观看的剪纸戏台：圆润妖客从层叠雾幕后探出，摊炉与订单像舞台机关般清晰运动，气氛温暖而带一点神秘。\",\n      \"visualKeywords\": [\n        \"layered paper cutout\",\n        \"frontal theater\",\n        \"soft silhouettes\",\n        \"scalloped edges\",\n        \"lantern glow\",\n        \"mist curtains\"\n      ],\n      \"palette\": [\n        \"#171B2E\",\n        \"#39405F\",\n        \"#F2B45B\",\n        \"#F7DFA4\",\n        \"#C96E63\",\n        \"#A9C9B8\"\n      ],\n      \"characterStyle\": \"妖客采用二至三头身的宽底豆形轮廓，短肢、圆角纸片五官和单一醒目标志物；每种顾客依靠耳、角、帽檐或尾巴改变外轮廓，不依赖细碎纹理辨认。\",\n      \"environmentStyle\": \"固定正视角的三层纸艺舞台：前景柜台、中景炉具与顾客位、后景屋檐和雾幕分别独立分层；以轻微视差、纸边阴影和少量蒸汽形变制造纵深，便于用少量透明贴图搭建。\",\n      \"uiStyle\": \"圆角木牌与扇贝边纸签组成的横向HUD；订单是悬挂式圆角票签，升级按钮为宽大的拱顶牌，进度条模拟一串逐渐点亮的小灯笼。\",\n      \"iconConcept\": \"用单色剪纸轮廓表现团子、妖灯、炉火和升级：粗轮廓、中央镂空、最多两层颜色，在小尺寸下仍可识别。\",\n      \"forbiddenElements\": [\n        \"known characters or mascots\",\n        \"brand marks or logos\",\n        \"named artist imitation\",\n        \"photorealism\",\n        \"thin fragile outlines\",\n        \"dense ornamental patterns\",\n        \"horror gore\"\n      ],\n      \"productionComplexity\": \"low\",\n      \"previewPrompt\": \"Original 16:9 web-lite idle shop game screen for 妖怪夜市, a warm mysterious yokai dessert stall presented as a frontal layered paper-cut theater. Show a broad squat bean-shaped mist customer with tiny limbs and a unique crescent ear silhouette waiting at the counter, an automatic stove producing three moon-dew dango, glowing lantern currency, and a clear stove-upgrade action. Construct the scene from three visibly se