\"previewPrompt\": \"Original 16:9 web-lite idle shop game screen for 妖怪夜市 in a bold carved-print visual language. Build a diagonal night-market alley from large high-contrast blocks and reusable linocut textures. Show an angular diamond-bodied mist customer with a forked top silhouette advancing along the diagonal queue toward a corner dessert stall. The automatic stove holds moon-dew dango; a delivery reward appears as an amber lantern token; a stove upgrade is clearly actionable. Use generous cream-colored negative-space mist, dark indigo carved masses, restrained brick-red, amber, teal, and dusty violet spot colors. UI geometry is sharp: notched rectangles, trapezoid order plaques, a carved-slot production bar, and a broad wedge-shaped upgrade button. Friendly mystery, bold readable silhouettes, no known characters, no logos, no brands, no named-artist imitation, no text-heavy interface.\",\n      \"previewPath\": \"previews/direction_c.png\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"direction_d\",\n      \"name\": \"雾线织图\",\n      \"summary\": \"把整间夜市做成俯视刺绣地图：细长飘带状妖客沿缝线小路游向摊位，布块建筑与线结反馈带来柔软、独特且容易模块化的画面。\",\n      \"visualKeywords\": [\n        \"embroidered textile\",\n        \"top-down map\",\n        \"ribbon creatures\",\n        \"patchwork stalls\",\n        \"stitched paths\",\n        \"knot motifs\"\n      ],\n      \"palette\": [\n        \"#20243B\",\n        \"#5D315B\",\n        \"#D65F6E\",\n        \"#F1B95B\",\n        \"#B8D8C0\",\n        \"#F4E7CF\"\n      ],\n      \"characterStyle\": \"妖客采用俯视可读的细长飘带轮廓，约四至六倍身长，头部是较大的线结，尾端分叉或盘卷；角色通过行进曲线、结形和背部少量大色块区分，避免复杂逐帧肢体动画。\",\n      \"environmentStyle\": \"正俯视的拼布夜市地图：摊位、炉具、等候区和雾池是不同形状的布片，缝线路径连接顾客入口与柜台；用滚动线纹、轻微布面起伏和发光线结表现生产与奖励，而非透视建筑。\",\n      \"uiStyle\": \"圆环、胶囊和线轴形控件构成柔性HUD；订单围绕顾客头像形成半圆针脚，生产进度沿螺旋线轴推进，升级按钮是醒目的双层椭圆布章。\",\n      \"iconConcept\": \"每个图标都是一个可辨识的刺绣结：三结串代表团子，环形流苏代表妖灯，向上箭头由两条交叉针脚构成；以粗线和纯色底布保证缩小时清晰。\",\n      \"forbiddenElements\": [\n        \"known characters or mascots\",\n        \"brand marks or logos\",\n        \"named artist imitation\",\n        \"real cultural or ceremonial textile replicas\",\n        \"micro-stitch detail\",\n        \"photoreal fabric simulation\",\n        \"busy repeating patterns under controls\",\n        \"thin low-contrast UI\"\n      ],\n      \"productionComplexity\": \"medium\",\n      \"previewPrompt\": \"Original 16:9 top-down web-lite idle shop game interface for 妖怪夜市 designed as an embroidered patchwork map. A long ribbon-shaped mist customer with a large knotted head and forked curling tail follows a stitched path toward a dessert-stall fabric patch. Show a circular stove patch automatically making three moon-dew dango, a serving interaction at the counter seam, glowing tassel-like lantern currency, and a prominent upgrade control. Buildings are flat irregular cloth pieces, mist is pale layered gauze shapes, motion trails are animated stitches. UI uses rings, capsules, spool-shaped progress, semicircular order stitches, and a double-oval fabric-badge upgrade button. Deep blue and plum cloth, coral, honey gold, mint, warm cream; clean large forms suitable for browser production. No known characters, logos, brands, copied textile motifs, or imitation of any named artist; avoid text-heavy UI.\",\n      \"previewPath\": \"previews/direction_d.png\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n--- approval ---\nselected_direction: direction_c\nkeep: []\nchange: []\nnotes:\n  - 第三个图的风格最好\n",
